d region to a file\n+    outside the repo rather than to stdout, so it cannot be swept into an\n+    agent transcript. Today the only route is `cledger export` piped\n+    through a hand-written filter.\n - Whether an explicit `Conversation` manifest object earns its keep once\n   multiple producers exist.","is_error":false,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FUYDhgVTQPoaPSQmJZqFxR","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"worktree-spec-verification-gaps","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge/.claude/worktrees/spec-verification-gaps","head":"317ebfdd7d408762610302d539d820c7bc5b626f","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:a6b0721f-3d36-4802-bc44-520ed792e1b6","seq":934},"id":"ev1-e91827ed3d744e0455c440c81ddf426495ad525c586274757f52ce6d9d21ca92","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-28T02:51:57.771Z","producer":{"session_id":"a6b0721f-3d36-4802-bc44-520ed792e1b6","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.220","tool":"cledger","version":"0.13.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge/.claude/worktrees/spec-verification-gaps","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"worktree-spec-verification-gaps","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"content":"diff --git a/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md b/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\nindex fe10ebb..3c960d3 100644\n--- a/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\n+++ b/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\n@@ -480,5 +480,30 @@ for now (see the format-drift roadmap item).\n   (the full system prompt), sandbox/approval policy, reasoning effort — is\n   still uncaptured. Whether whole-session configuration belongs in the\n   ledger at all, and under which kind, is its own question.\n+- **Scan findings are not inspectable enough to act on** (reported\n+  2026-07-27 while dogfooding turnbridge). `formatFinding` prints ~20\n+  characters of context each side with the match itself replaced by\n+  `<redacted>`, and there is no supported way to see the fl